## 4. Modular ownership boundaries

The branch preserves the event-surface split:

```text
runtime/bus/actionEvent.mjs
  validation and normalization of action-event envelopes only

runtime/bus/actionEventHistory.mjs
  bounded in-memory retention, sequence assignment, duplicate retained eventId rejection, and read/query only

runtime/bus/actionEventSubscriptionRegistry.mjs
  live same-process listener registration, actionId/runId/type filtering, publication, subscription argument normalization, and unsubscribe behavior only

runtime/bus/actionEventReplay.mjs
  optional retained in-memory replay plus live-join buffering/dedupe only

runtime.mjs
  composition root / dependency injection / public API export only
```

No broad event manager was introduced.

`actionEventReplay.mjs` does not import or own:

```text
runtime.mjs
workerBridge.mjs
llama_worker/**
runtime/request/**
runtime/stream/**
runtime/lifecycle/**
runtime/backends/**
runtime/router/**
runtime/services/**
executeAction internals
```

