## 6. Public/API state

Current public runtime API surface:

```text
cancelAction
cancelPrompt
executeAction
initModel
prompt
readActionEvents
resetModel
resetSession
shutdownRuntime
subscribeActionEvents
```

The event/control loop now supports:

```text
executeAction(actionEnvelope or accepted orchestration descriptor)
  -> Capability Bus / execute-action dispatch chain
  -> nativeWorkerBackend for supported text.generate route
  -> started + terminal outcome event publication
  -> bounded in-memory readActionEvents(...) readback
  -> opt-in subscribeActionEvents(..., { replay: true }) retained replay + live observation
  -> default subscribeActionEvents(...) live-only same-process observation

cancelAction(actionId)
  -> actionId/requestId registry lookup
  -> existing cancelPrompt(requestId)
  -> existing scheduler/request/worker cancellation path
  -> existing execute-action cancelled outcome mapping
```

